    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Buuneeda manda mureeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aleaydiit ea Israeli, gigasayi aghaawana eenda Yordani askweareani, una ak giimbali eemoojiga saang'a mideawa uurjeenga ea gaburdeaweey, mujiinajeega hees sideas ghamarda nyaawa ea ghwahita humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga hees nea haloodi, diibiga Anakimu ang'iing'i inali, nea abeeda ea niyiinyi nea geeyeena, ‘Gayghoamu ng'eaha ghamiinaada aba madeeda diibiga Anakimu?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean bisiina nala gidang'eada ghamneawa gideaba siida asheedeawaneey uurji beasta NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gil; gaygahuuyda sean nea ghwanung' goobeedeayi sean aba madeadaang'u, ak gayhoana aba madeadaang'u nea ginung' gwarooda aba damandida, ghoah gidarukuteayda NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adiidu giyeeni aba gurooroadaang'u, ng'ata nea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U nihoan gwarita aba madeadaang'u, giyeeni ‘NG'UTAMIIDA ghoahiitanaan heeda ng'eanyiida jea deambal aba gideaba gahaguuwnyi’; gweagu ramaseanyeekeaba eemoojisu hean NG'UTAMIIDA gwariteawa madeadaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea mii doobiiwnataang'u gil ghanea doobiiwnata gurooroadaang'u gil gideaba ghamneawa gajuna jeeda ng'eanyiida nyaawa ak giimbaliischi, gweagu ramaseanyeeka eemoojisu abeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U hean gwariteawa madeadaang'u, ak ghoahang'waay ng'asheanda abeeda aksa NG'UTAMIIDA habeawooda ghweanigeagwa was Abrahamu, ea Isaka ea Yakobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hean nala gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U maygagoonyi ng'eanyiida miy ambala aba doobiiwnataang'u aba gideaba goowooschi fuga hang'oonyi iheeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apkaada adiidu gwarooseey gidisimi NG'UTAMIIDA ea ghwanyareas aba jeeda dareapcheeda; gidang'eada eaweeda iriteawi ng'eanyiida Misri, bwak ea ahiini hiji, noosisi ramaseanyeeka NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean eara aba Horebu ghoanyareaschi NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghwanyareas NG'UTAMIIDA aba badahuukeagwa ea gagasa gahuuydaneegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda eadiing'deawi uhuuda giijeeda damwaghaada lagheanga baragi was lagheanga neajeeda heeleesa NG'UTAMIIDA sea agooga, geabiidi hoowa eawooji haradam askweari ea eawa; nea mwaayaagi mukaate nea ea mwaaleahi beega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gagoonan NG'UTAMIIDA lagheanga iyeenya sing'waara mooneeda ASEETA; nea geeng'oorsa badahuuka ng'asheega sean ghayi rukuneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA aba giijeeda rinna nyeashta bugusta beasta eaweeda sibateewa geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iing'ata muudeanooda eawooji haradam eawa ea askweari gagoonan NG'UTAMIIDA laghean iyeenya, was lagheanga neajeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Ng'eadana hiji lamwaja rarang'aada; aba gideaba fugaagu ghayi iiruuni Misri nisin ng'asheega munyas; niyamwa geat naweeda ghayi earukusi; nisissa geat sanaamu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gabiikta gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA gicha, ‘Naadaayi fiisu, ak ging'ulayi, fuga hang'oonyi iheenga gil; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikseani dahuuyda saawa ak geahuti gheawunga nyaawa aba badayda ng'eanyiida; ak gaydanung' huwa eemeeda saang'a hees uurjeen ng'al saawa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaayamnyi geaw ak ghaahiing'aani uhuuda giijeeda nea abeeda giijeeda ghwayeada beasta; nea laghean iyeenya bea neajeeda gwanda geatingeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaang'weardi, ak ghaadaayi noosisi riing'eeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA; noosisi geat meayda gharinyeanda, noayami geat naweeda ghayi rukuneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghaang'waanyi lagheanga asiyeenyean, ak geajakteawi geatingeasu, ak gwanyariisa madeedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geahiing'si geaw ng'eanyi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA gawuurji gidaghayi bea mwadi, eawooji haradam askweari ea eawa; nea mwaayaagi mukaate nea eara beega ea mwaaleahi, aba riing'eega sean oosinyi, aba ramaseanyeekeagwa, aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ghoanung' ghwanyareas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda ghoabealan nyarasta uurji beasta ahiimneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA, nea gagasa gahuuydaneegwa. Ng'ata gooleeysinean iit NG'UTAMIIDA aba damandida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwanyareeksa NG'UTAMIIDA muuchi Haruni nea gagasa gwanuus, hean geamusiischeesi Haruni aba damandida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu gida was riing'eedeang'wa, meayda oosisi geat, hean ghaaghwardi aba beasta ng'ata geagulji ak ghaang'aali ea gabumbuniit ea gawuurji birjeanda; hit geajaksi birjeandaanyi jeeda eenda rarang'aana giijeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eara aba Dabera Masa, ea Gibrot-hataafa, ghoanyareaschi NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda ajeakteaweegwa NG'UTAMIIDA aba Gadesh-barneya, nea gwayi, ‘Aweayeena ambala ng'eanyiida neagoonyeegwa,’ ea moosisiini mureeda digheanyeeka NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, nea ea mudu eatawa masaweega ghana ooleeysiina iit ghuutaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agooga neaheawi asisiina mureeda NG'UTAMIIDA gidang'eada eaweeda anaalaneegwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ata geahing'si geaw ng'eanyi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba eawoojisu aharadamiin askweari ea eawa, aba gideaba nirugu NG'UTAMIIDA gideaba Gaydahuuydaneegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaamwaashchi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, adiidu gihuydi fugaagu ea hearaniischoadaang'u ghayi ilealu aba uurdaang'u, iiruuni ng'eanyiida Misri aba geatindaang'u hoauur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
