          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fiisu ea gaagu gil was fuga jea gwahearaniischi, ilealu aba uurdaang'u ea aba geatindaang'u doabiiwaat.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
